# key|department|description|action|rationale (or @template)|confidence (H default, M, L)
# One line per vendor, in the same order as data/vendors_source.csv. `key` is a prefix of the vendor name used as an alignment check.
Salesforce Uk Ltd-Uk|Sales|CRM platform used to manage sales pipeline, customer accounts and revenue operations.|Optimize|Largest vendor at about 40% of total spend. First confirm the contract type. If seat licences: audit licences, editions and add-on clouds against active users, remove unused seats and renegotiate at renewal. If a platform or reseller agreement tied to the product: renegotiate the fee rate and minimum commitment. Saving assumes 15%; the range is 10-20% until the contract is reviewed.|M
Navan (Tripactions Inc)|G&A|Corporate travel booking and expense management platform (formerly TripActions); spend is mostly pass-through travel.|Optimize|Keep as the single travel channel. Tighten travel policy (advance booking, class and hotel caps) and merge the duplicate Navan, Inc vendor record.
Bdo Llp|Finance|Audit, tax and accounting advisory firm.|Consolidate|@audit|M
Tog Uk Properties Limited|Facilities|The Office Group: London flexible/serviced office space provider.|Optimize|Largest office cost. Cut to a small London hub sized to actual attendance (target about 50% reduction), subject to the lease break date.|M
Cloudcrossing Bvba|Sales|Belgian maker of PDF Butler, a document generation app for Salesforce (quotes, proposals, contracts).|Optimize|Significant spend for a single component. Benchmark against alternatives (Conga, native Salesforce document generation) and renegotiate volume pricing.|M
Zagrebtower D.O.O.|Facilities|Landlord of the Zagreb Tower office building (Zagreb office lease).|Optimize|Core engineering-hub lease. Hand back or sublet surplus floor space to match hybrid attendance (target about 40% reduction), subject to the break clause.|M
Innovent Spaces Private Limited|Facilities|Managed office / coworking space provider in India.|Optimize|Keep as the single India site, absorb the Work Easy team, and renegotiate the desk count (target about 40% reduction), subject to contract term.|M
Weking D.O.O.|Facilities|Croatian company not confirmed from public sources; spend size suggests an office lease (site to be confirmed).|Optimize|8th-largest vendor with no confirmed purpose. Require the contract and a named owner within 30 days. If it is a second Zagreb lease it overlaps with Zagrebtower and should be merged into one site. No saving is assumed until verified.|L
Jensten Insurance Brokers|Finance|UK commercial insurance broker (business insurance policies).|Consolidate|Spend is mostly insurance premiums placed through the broker. Two brokers are used (Jensten UK, Shoff Darby US); consolidate onto one programme, ideally the parent company's, and re-market at renewal.|M
Gpt Space & Co|Facilities|GPT Group's flexible workspace / coworking offices in Australia.|Terminate|Premium flexible office for the Australian team. Exit at membership end and move to remote working; saving is net of an allowance for on-demand desks.|M
